                    <head/>
                    <msContents>
                        <summary>An illustrated otogizōshi handscroll. Although bearing the title
                            Hinazuru (ひな鶴), its contents correspond to the tale conventionally known
                            as Sazareishi, a celebratory narrative in which Princess Sazareishi,
                            daughter of Emperor Seimu, attains longevity and prosperity through her
                            devotion to Yakushi Nyorai.</summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="ja">Japanese</textLang>
                        <msItem>
                            <title key="">ひな鶴</title>
                            <title key="">Hinazuru</title>
                        </msItem>
                    </msContents>
                    <physDesc>
                        <objectDesc form="roll">
                            <supportDesc material="paper">
